    <profile name="Mutant Regeneration" id="c0da-1775-8e72-8003" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, this model regains up to D3 lost wounds.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Unnatural Toughness" id="aaa3-542c-91e0-9277" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model in this unit would lose a wound, roll one D6: on a 6, that wound is not lost. If the model already has a similar ability, add 1 to the result of the roll.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Lord of the Machines [Aura]" id="3f18-bbc7-092f-b3ed" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly &lt;HERETEK&gt; CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, re-roll a hit roll of 1.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Awaken the Machine" id="cdd9-6dc6-b53f-522f" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, this model can awaken one friendly VEHICLE model within 3&quot; of it. 
Until the start of your next Command phase, each time that model loses a wound, roll a D6, on a 6+ the wound is not lost.
If the model already has a similar ability, add 1 to said roll.
Each model can only be awakened once per turn.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Fieldwork" id="1a97-fbf5-6e15-fc76" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of your Movement phase, this model can heal one friendly INFANTRY or BEAST model without INORGANIC Keyword within 3&quot; of it. That model regains up to 3 Wounds.
If the selected unit is not at Starting Strength, but all it&apos;s remaining models have all it&apos;s wounds remaining, one of the selected unit&apos;s destroyed models is returned to its unit with its full wounds remaining.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Cultist" id="6bdc-5d45-fcf2-2e48" hidden="false" typeId="800f-21d0-4387-c943" typeName="Model">
      <comment>6bdc-5d45-fcf2-2e48</comment>
