          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name="Heretek Cult - Silica Animus" id="48fb-77b6-266b-6502" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <comment>The creation of an artificial machine mind (rather than a simple digital cogitator) using forbidden technologies is considered perhaps the greatest sin in the Cult Mechanicus and is a terrible crime under Imperial law.</comment>
              <costs>
                <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
