                  <infoLinks>
                    <infoLink name="Out of Bounds ability table" id="3f0f-19f7-e9d9-2ed2" hidden="false" targetId="c602-4abb-0beb-74f4" type="infoGroup"/>
                  </infoLinks>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Bound Testing" id="011a-c07e-058c-854d" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, you can select to Push the bounds, or keep within know parameters.
In case of Push, roll a 1D6, if the result is greater than the current Battle round, HERETEK CULT units from your army receive a Push Bonus ability as shown in the following table. Those abilities are cumulative.
If the result is equal or lesser than the current Battle round, HERETEK CULT units from your army gain the corresponding ability from the Out of Bounds ability table. If you already have the corresponding ability, no Out of Bounds ability is gained.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
