      <profiles>
        <profile name="Fearsome [Aura]" id="c7e4-344c-7da8-3070" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While an enemy unit is within 6&quot; of this unit, subtract 1 from the Leadership characteristic of models in that unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Hideous Regeneration" id="18e6-c2f1-7182-0fc8" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time an enemy unit shoots or fights, after it has finished making its attacks, if any model in this unit lost any wounds as a result of those attacks but was not destroyed, that model immediately regains all of its lost wounds.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Mutated Beyond Reason" id="85bf-afaf-2886-1558" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This unit cannot perform actions. 
The first time this unit is selected to fight in each Fight phase, roll one D3: until the end of the phase, this unit gains the relevant mutation from the table below:
1 - Razor Claws: Change the Armour Penetration characteristic of hideous mutations models in this unit are equipped with to -4.
2 - Grasping Pseudopods: Change the Attacks characteristic of models in this unit to 3D3.
3 - Toxic Haemorrhage: Each time a model in this unit makes an attack, you can re-roll the wound roll against units without the VEHICLE, TITANIC or INORGANIC Keywords.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
