                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When you select this Warlord Trait, select one weapon this WARLORD is equipped with (excluding Relics). Add 1 to the Strength and Damage characteristics of that weapon.</characteristic>
