                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, select one friendly &lt;HERETEK&gt; CORE unit within 9&quot; of this WARLORD.
Until the start of your next Command phase, if that unit is performing an action, it can make ranged attacks without that action failing.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
