                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a HERETEK CULT CORE unit within 6&quot; of this WARLORD makes a melee attack against a unit without INORGANIC, VEHICLE or TITANIC Keywords, an unmodified hit roll of 6 automatically wounds the target.</characteristic>
