                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly HERETEK CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this WARLORD, each time that unit is selected to shoot, if that unit made a Normal Move in your previous Movement phase, then until its shooting attacks have been resolved, it counts as having Remained Stationary.</characteristic>
