                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the beggining of your Command phase, roll one D6 for each Out of Bounds Malus ability your army has active. If the result of the roll is equal to the roll for that ability, you lose that Out of Bounds ability.</characteristic>
