                    <characteristic name="D" typeId="ae8a-3137-d65b-4ca7">1</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">If a Hit roll is scored, the target unit suffers D3 mortal wounds. If a CHARACTER is slain by this weapon, you can add a Chaos Spawn to your army within 6&quot; of the character and more than 1&quot; from any enemy models before they are removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
