                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If your army is Battle-forged and the wearer is on the battlefield, roll a D6 each time you or your opponent uses a Stratagem. On a 5+ you gain 1 Command Point.</characteristic>
